Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 755 "[Lemegeton] Space of Depravity"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900273000
    Collect 1 of 900274000

Requires (player level >= 74 and player is karus and quest 753 is completed) or (player level >= 74 and player is elmorad and quest 754 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Whew, it's endless. But we're not too far away. First, let's return to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Whew, it's endless. But we're not too far away. First, let's return to Seis of [Order of the Sorcery].!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [27Devil] Ronove and [51Devil] Balam."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [27Devil] Ronove and [51Devil] Balam."

On in_progress
    Say "Where did you place the seal?"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Thank you.Now sealed with the soul drank in the ring will be locked."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Thank you.Now sealed with the soul in the ring. It will be locked."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "There is a devil who knows what the true chivalry is. It's [Devil 15] Eligos whom you must fight against this time. Actually, he's a brave knight rather than a devil. Since you're one of the great knights, I think it'll be a fair battle for both of you, <selfname>. Additionally, please seal [Devil 39] Malphas and [Devil 62] Volac, who are with [Devil 15] Eligos."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "The [Devil15]Eligos is one of the true devils. You <selfname> are a great knight, so it would be an epic battle for you two. [Devil39]Malphas and [Devil62]Volac are to be sealed as well."
